---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Industry Experience | Rashmi Dangol">
  <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto py-20 px-6">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-black mb-8 reveal">Industry <span class="text-primary">Experience</span></h1>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="card bg-base-200 p-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-3 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Product Placement Phenotyping Intern | Syngenta, Malta, IL</h2>
          <!-- <span class="badge badge-primary badge-lg"></span> -->
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-4">
          Worked with geospatial data, remote sensing workflows, and data-driven decision support for agricultural applications.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-base-content/80">
          <li>Created digital field maps using Google Earth Pro and Self-Service Shape for precise project planning and spatial analysis</li>
          <li>Led flight operations using DJI Matrice 300 RTK drone to capture high resolution imagery for early-season vigor and corn emergence quality.</li>
          <li>Collaborated on a Python-based machine-learning image processing pipeline to generate first-model estimators for crop health indices.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card bg-base-200 p-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 400ms;">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-3 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Seed Technology Intern | Bayer, Oxnard,CA</h2>
          <!-- <span class="badge badge-secondary badge-lg">Applied Research</span> -->
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-4">
            Assisted in the development of seed quality protocols and data collection for seed performance evaluation.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-base-content/80">
          <li>Executed field data collection for yield performance using GPS rovers, ensuring high data integrity for the LATAM seeds technical sheets</li>
          <li>Managed soil analysis and tissue culture data via the Smart Farm Plus application to support seed quality protocols.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    
    <div class="card bg-base-200 p-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 400ms;">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-3 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Digital Enumerator/Surveyor | CIMMYT, Nepal</h2>
          <!-- <span class="badge badge-secondary badge-lg">Applied Research</span> -->
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-4">
          Conducted digital surveys and data collection for agricultural research and development projects.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-base-content/80">
          <li>Led a 6-member team for the National Seed and Fertilizer Project (NSAF), leveraging KoboToolbox to digitize data collection and evaluate the effectiveness of ICT tools among rural smallholder farmers.</li>
          
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
